            <div xml:id="d536">

                <pb facs="0540" n="531" sameAs="frus:frus1938v05/pg531"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2231/279: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Ecuador</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Long</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-08-08T10:00:00-04:00">August 8, 1938—10
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>46. Your 92, August 6, 7 p.m.<anchor n="25" xml:id="d536-f1"/> No release
                    whatever will be issued to press here and no publicity whatever will be given
                    until we know Schedule II changes (Department’s 44) have been made. Make certain
                    Ecuadorans withhold any publicity until this matter settled. Rush reply.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
